tep-by-Step Instructions for Tomorrow:
Start and log into your EC2 instance via the AWS Console or your terminal.

Navigate to the backtesting folder:

Bash
cd ~/trading/googleengine/backtesting
Run your launcher script:

Bash
./run_scanner.sh
Because your run_scanner.sh script uses GNU screen (screen -dmS smc_bot ...), it automatically launches the bot inside a detached background session. This means it will keep running indefinitely even after you close your terminal or log out.

Useful Commands to Remember:
To check live logs while it's running:

Bash
tail -f scanner.log
To view/re-attach to the live bot terminal session:

Bash
screen -r smc_bot
(Once attached, press Ctrl+A then D to detach and leave it running in the background again).

To safely stop the bot later:

Bash
screen -S smc_bot -X quit